                                    <strong>Restore Purchases</strong>
                                    <p>If you reinstalled FlowSense and your Premium status isn't showing, tap <strong>Restore Purchases</strong>. This queries Google Play to verify your active subscription and re-activates Premium features. Requires an internet connection.</p>
